                </div>

                <div className="mt-auto pt-8 text-center relative z-10">
                   <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Thank you for shopping with us!</p>
                   <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Items sold are not refundable unless proven defective within 24 hours.</p>
